	(text "Pico firmware:\n- encoder, DS0/DS1, SD card change from shift register, SW4, SW5\n- GPIO0: output 2MHz system clock\n- GPIO3: output 100Hz irq\n(buffer both through 74AHCT1G125?)\n- footprints\n- SW4/SW5 need pullups?"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 20.828 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0363588a-1455-423c-a934-585b01d2e633")
	)
	(text "Pullups are necessary on all lines"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.748 78.232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
		)
		(uuid "03e2981f-e597-425d-8162-76e2371b8cf5")
	)
	(text "input GPIO: encoder pins\ninputs: 3x encoder, 2x DS0/DS1, 1x SD card switch (6 of 8)\npower: 5V, musi być HCT\npackage: same as cpu replacer thingy\n\nCP=clock z pico\nQ7=data do pico (przez level shift)\n~{PL}=load strobe z pico\n~{CE}->GND\nDS->GND (serial input)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230.759 272.542 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0b399603-c9ba-4a0a-8659-f44e67d80bd9")
	)
	(text "J1:\n- switch chooses ROM\n  from 32K half of 27C512\n  closed = bottom half\n  open = top half\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 405.003 107.696 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "15019967-76fc-4450-9e48-92770c74d5d5")
	)
	(text "Connection block:\nif shift register idea fails\nreconnect Pico to encoder"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.208 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "227d4570-2c49-4928-a7c3-d59bbd237e65")
	)
	(text "* Resistor values need to be adjusted according to type\nof LED installed on front panel. Sensible values for\nbright LEDs is significantly higher than what is specified."
